1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,582
Baca nota berjam-jam… tapi masuk dewan, otak kosong?

2
00:00:04,022 --> 00:00:07,372
Kajian dapati, baca semula dan highlight antara cara paling

3
00:00:07,372 --> 00:00:08,281
kurang berkesan.

4
00:00:08,721 --> 00:00:10,270
Ni empat teknik yang jimat masa.

5
00:00:10,710 --> 00:00:14,881
Satu, Active Recall. Tutup buku, tanya diri: apa ciri-ciri

6
00:00:14,881 --> 00:00:18,117
negara bangsa Melaka? Jawab dulu, baru semak.

7
00:00:18,557 --> 00:00:22,975
Dua, Blurting. Atas kertas kosong, tulis semua pasal Pembesar

8
00:00:22,975 --> 00:00:27,682
Empat Lipatan. Semak nota, tambah yang tertinggal guna pen merah.

9
00:00:28,122 --> 00:00:31,622
Tiga, Teknik Feynman. Terangkan Hukum Kanun Melaka macam ajar

10
00:00:31,622 --> 00:00:33,974
adik. Tersekat? Situlah yang belum faham.

11
00:00:34,414 --> 00:00:39,166
Empat, Spaced Repetition. Ulang topik sama hari 1, 3 dan 7.

12
00:00:39,166 --> 00:00:41,664
Sikit-sikit, tapi melekat lama.

13
00:00:42,104 --> 00:00:44,829
Rutin harian: 25 minit, satu subtopik.

14
00:00:44,829 --> 00:00:48,127
Baca, blurting, semak, terangkan. Esok, ulang.

15
00:00:48,567 --> 00:00:50,478
Teknik mana korang nak cuba dulu malam ni?

16
00:00:50,478 --> 00:00:51,207
Komen kat bawah!
